<title>GERMANY: Strabag 96 construction output up at 6.25 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Strabag 96 construction output up at 6.25 bln dmk.</headline>
<text>
<p>COLOGNE, Germany, Feb 25, Reuter - Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     6,250   up 3 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Strabag AG. The group said that it expected its operating result in 1996 to be negative, but better than 1995. It said its 1997 result would be at least as good as in the previous year.</p>
</text>
